Z||000007||Raydar||08-30-2001||11:16 PM||||Fix your speed sensor wiring. <BR>Seems that I remember a missing (or disconnected) speed sensor could cause stalling on a manual trans car.<BR>When I read the article, it made perfect sense at the time, although I don't remember the details exactly.<BR>Worth a try.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
